  message: "SHIPPED as PR #498 (dev 544038bc9a). java/objc/rust stamp call_construct on the unresolved-external method path; the registry-driven parity gate (test_disclosure_parity.py) is driven from the shipped io_primitives catalogues so a language arriving later with method-kind sinks and no fixture FAILS instead of going silently blind. Layer 3: java bare confirmed (rc 0) -> confirmed_with_caveats (rc 3) naming u.mkdirs / xs.size, control arm (typed java.io.File receiver) still violated rc 1."  # 7dd0
